#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:11
msgid ""
"Scopes define network service boundaries within a network server "
"integration. Scopes can be used to segment and organize network resources, "
"providing logical isolation for different environments, tenants, or "
"applications. |morpheus| supports creating, editing, and managing scopes on "
"network integrations that expose this capability."
msgstr ""
"Scopes define network servicio boundaries dentro de un network servidor "
"integration. Scopes se puede usar a segment y organize network recursos, "
"providing logical isolation para diferente entornos, tenants, o "
"aplicaciones. |morpheus| soporta creating, editing, y managing scopes en "
"network integrations ese expose este capability."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Scopes tab is available on network server integrations that support this"
" feature (``hasScopes`` flag). The tab title may vary based on the "
"integration type."
msgstr ""
"El Scopes pestaña está disponible en network servidor integrations ese "
"support este función (``hasScopes`` flag). El pestaña title puede vary "
"basado en el integration tipo."

