"Controls cual Grupos tienen acceso al scope. Seleccionar \"Todos\" para "
"todos Grupos, o seleccionar específico Grupos para restricted acceso."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:73
msgid "Tenant Permissions"
msgstr "Tenant Permissions"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:75
msgid ""
"Set to Public for all Tenants to access the scope, or Private to restrict to"
" specific Tenants."
msgstr ""
"Establecer a Público para todos Inquilinos a acceso el scope, o Privado a "
"restrict a específico Inquilinos."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:78
msgid "Required Role Permissions"
msgstr "Requerido Role Permissions"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_scopes.rst:80
msgid ""
